[temp.deduct]/8 + [temp.deduct.conv]: when the conversion-function
template's return type does not mention the template parameter,
deduction fails, so the template is not a viable candidate for
implicit conversion.  This test verifies that CBMC correctly
rejects the conversion in this case (matching standard-conforming
compilers).
